==Battleground==
*4 [[South Seas Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Hippoe]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[South Seas Otter]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[South Seas Doge]]s spawn, delay 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>.
**Infinite [[South Seas Doge]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.
**2 [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 53.33~56.67 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Regardless of your lineup going into this stage, as long as you have some sort of ranged attacker like [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cat]] or [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]], you'll find that enemy magnifications leave a lot to be desired.

